  "source": "module arithmetic_counter_add(input logic clk,reset,en,output logic [3:0] q);\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) q <= 4'b0000;\n        else if (en) q <= q + 4'b0001;\n    end\nendmodule\n",
